window.products.push({"id":945027,"name":"Moongiantgo High Pressure Steam Cleaner, 1700W High Temp Portable Bathroom Power Cleaning Machine For Engine, Tankless and Heavy Duty for Home Use Gro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k8u+9owbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[EXCELLENT PERFORMANCE] This professional steam cleaner can support running for 3-4 hours without overheating. The outstanding continuous work ability can not only easily complete household steam cleaning tasks, but also can be used for commercial use. Portable but powerful! [READY IN 20 SECONDS] There is no need for the lengthy preheating time required before use like traditional kettle-type steam cleaners. NOTE: The temperature of the steam drops sharply upon contact with air, the closer to the nozzle, the higher the temperature, up to 230°F at the nozzle. Do not touch the nozzle directly with your hands when using it. [TANKLESS DESIGN] The tankless design allows you not to refill the water frequently, which can greatly reduce your workload and is more suitable for long-time cleaning work. The home steam cleaner has a built-in 4-foot water inlet hose that can be put into an external water bucket as a water source. [BUILT TO LAST]The efficient built-in evaporator and liner are all made of 304# SUS, durable and sturdy. And the thickened ABS carrying case can bear up to 300lbs. It's definitely a sound investment! [DESCALING REGULARLY] If the amount of steam is decreasing, please immediately perform descaling work on the machine: mix water with edible vinegar or citric acid at a ratio of 1: 1, remove the nozzle, turn the regulator clockwise to the wettest point, start operation as normal and cycle for 5-10 minutes, after that rinse with clean water, and turn off the machine. [RELIABLE CUSTOMER SERVICE] 1-year warranty: free replacement for any quality problems. And we also provide lifetime online tech support. Any questions, please feel free to contact us. We are always behind our products! [ABOUT STEAM FUNCTION] After turning on the machine, first press the switch on spray gun to make running light on, and select 4 level to spray cold water. Then press spray gun switch again to make running light off, Now the steam switch can be turned on and start to use the 1-3 level Steam Function.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71k8u+9owbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moongiantgo","source_asin":"B0892FZ8L2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945027","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0892FZ8L2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0892FZ8L2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
