window.products.push({"id":945035,"name":"Christmas Tree Decorations Ornaments Set: Shatterproof Christmas Ornaments Balls for Xmas Tree Decor Assorted Christmas Ornaments Baubles Plastic Pack","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91n39zLmrdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Shatterproof Christmas Ornaments: Christmas balls made of eco-friendly solid material that have passed international quality certification are a better choice for families with kids and pets. They combine beauty, luster of real glass with unbreakable practicality of plastic. Our modern ornaments are perfect for reuse yearly. Different Style: Xmas Ornaments come in special textures: shiny, matte, and glittering. These ornaments sets feature handmade classic sparkling Christmas elements with high quality glitter, glaze base. They will be perfect for decorating your tree and become part of your holiday tradition. The arrangement of Christmas balls is sold in a 45 pack and contains different shape, sizes Christmas balls. Easy Decorating & Hanging: The ornament holder comes with a looped rope to make hanging ornaments easy. It saves time wearing rope, makes it easier to experience more fun of decorating your home. Our shatterproof ornaments are very light weight, so you don't need to worry about crushing your tree. They're easy to hang on any places you need to decorate. Perfect Choice for Decor: We have many different types of holiday ornaments balls to choose from. Whether you are looking for a traditional ball ornament or something more unique, there is sure to be a style that fits your needs. These big baubles can be used to celebrate a variety of occasions, including Christmas, weddings, engagements, anniversaries, and parties. It makes a great gift, too. Great Size & Upgraded Package Box: This set of 45pcs Christmas ornaments is perfect for most Christmas trees. The thicker plastic box and shatterproof test will help to keep your ball ornaments safe during transport. If you have any questions, please contact us right away. Batteries Required : False","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91n39zLmrdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VAINECHAY","source_asin":"B0B3XJS46F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3XJS46F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3XJS46F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
