window.products.push({"id":945081,"name":"LiteBee Car Trunk Organizer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E5MNkfxPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【70L LARGE CAPACITY】LiteBee Car Organizer is the best choice to say goodbye to chaos and keep your car tidy!The size of the trunk orgainizer: 27.95*12.99*11.42 inches. Its capacities up to 70L. Storage box can be expanded and contracted according to your needs for reasonable use.Best trunk organizer for car, suv, truck, jeep, mini van, vehicles in Automotive Interior Accessories. 【600D OXFORD CLOTH】Premium highest grade Oxford Cloth 600D material is more resistant than other fabrics on the market, resistant to dirt, waterproof, wear and easy to clean. All side walls and partitions are reinforced with 5 mm thick materials, and it has a strict sewing process and a special edging process, with higher stability and load capacity. 【MULTIPLE COMPARTMENTS】Trunk organizer features with the multi-compartment design which includes 2 main compartments, 6 mesh pockets, and 1 side pockets, you can design the compartments by adjusting the 4 removable dividers to fit different items and keep them perfectly separated, and with a cover, it can protect your items from dust for a long time and keep them clean and tidy. It is fully-collapsible for easy storage, and is designed to prevent your cargo from sliding. 【 REMOVABLE COOLER BAG】Removable cooler bag that comes with our car trunk organizer is exactly what you need for groceries, camping, or picnic.Foldable, freely retractable, 100% leakproof and insulated, longer cooling time up to 12H. The maximum capacity is 25L, space enough to store 20 cans of Coke, it can easily fit into one of the storage squares or can be used separately. 【STABLE STRUCTURE 】Non-slip mats on the bottom to avoid damaging the vehicle carpet. With 2 additional tie-down straps, this luggage storage box will no longer slide around when driving, and it can be stably fixed to your trunk. Unlike other people's handles that may enter your hands, our cylindrical soft handles are ergonomically designed and can be used comfortably even under heavy loads.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E5MNkfxPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LiteBee","source_asin":"B09MYW6CCW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MYW6CCW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MYW6CCW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
