window.products.push({"id":945148,"name":"Maximum HEAT Protection For Baking-Grilling-Managing Hot Items. Great Sale-Off For The Up-Coming Grilling Season!!! Time Limited Offer.! [Orange]","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-otgHPUNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Heat Resistant up to 425 F with 2mm Layer Thickness-The Newest Technique for Your Maximum Protection! The Highest Standard: FDA/BPA free/PA free/PVC free/Phthalate free-We confidently propose our certificate standard! 100% Pure Food Grade Silicone with NO Fillers. The Most Endurable Material- Stay with Time! 100% Waterproof. Anti Slip Texture with 10 seperate fingers- NOTHING can be MORE COMFORTABLE! MULTI-PURPOSE: Cooking/BBQ/ Opening cans/jars-Insulated Mittens/ Frezzer Safe & more! BEST LIFETIME GUARANTEE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-otgHPUNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PERFECT CHEF","source_asin":"B00S7H41GW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00S7H41GW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00S7H41GW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":945149,"name":"Simply Baked Large 5 Ounce Disposable Paper Baking Cups, 100 Pack of Cupcake Muffin Wrappers for Baking or Party, Treats, Candy, and Snack Cups, Lemon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L3t+tr6bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"At Simply Baked, we know that providing for your guests is your main priority, and doing it with ease and style is ours. Whether serving up some inspired cupcakes, gifting breads and cakes with our paper baking pans or adding that special message to your creation, you’ll find our unique baking line to be your path to elegant entertaining everyday! We have everything necessary to create the perfect occasion; grand or intimate. Cupcakes have never been so adorable. Breads, cakes and tarts have never traveled in such style, and our cupcake toppers and accessories add that perfect amount of whimsy to your table. Coordinating Designs - Not Just for Baking! Fall in love with our coordinating and stylish and versatile colors, designs, and sizes. Transform your baking cups into gorgeous displays of veggies, snacks, & dips. Our disposable products are oven and freezer safe and pre-greased - no need for cooking spray! We love these little babies with their fabulous colors and even more fabulous function! Choose from a plethora of colors that beautifully complement our large cups and serve as much more than baking cups – Fruit? Chips? Nuts? Candies? Of course! Better than traditional cupcake baking liners - these paper baking cups are sturdy so no muffin tin or cupcake pan necessary! They stand on their own on a flat sheet pan when baking. 50 per box | Holds 5 OZ | 2 1/8\" height | 2 3/8\" base | Pre-greased | Oven Safe up to 375 & Freezer Safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L3t+tr6bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simply Baked","source_asin":"B0911SPHG9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945149","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0911SPHG9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0911SPHG9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":945150,"name":"Terra Cotta Cazuelas, Round - 6 Inch (4 Dishes)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nDSeS+DdL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"These terra cotta baking and serving dishes are 1.25 inches deep, with approximately a 6 inch diameter to the outer edge. Because each cazuela is handmade, the measurements are not exact. When you use a classic terra cotta cazuela to cook with, you will find it heats evenly, and retains the heat longer than any other dish. So when you bring your soup, stew, or sizzling garlic shrimp to the table in a cazuela, you guarantee that your creation will be served at its best. But cooking is not the only use for these handy dishes. I use this size to serve a few olives, Marcona almonds, and other tapas. Cazuelas are very versatile -- that's why they have been used since the time of the Romans. The glaze on the cazuela is perfectly safe for cooking on the stovetop or in the oven -- it contains no lead. How to Cure Your New Cazuela for Cooking: If you are planning on cooking with your cazuela, you will need to soak and cure it using the following directions. Soak the entire dish in water to cover for 12 hours. Drain and wipe dry. Rub the unglazed bottom with a cut clove of garlic (we are not sure how the garlic works, but why argue with tradition?) Fill the dish with water to 1/2 inch below the rim, then add 1/2 cup of vinegar. Place the dish on a flame-tamer over low heat and slowly bring the water to a boil (no flame tamer? Crumple a sheet of aluminum foil and create a ring that you place over your burner to create about an inch of space between the heat and the cazuela). Let the liquid boil down until only about 1/2 cup remains. Cool slowly and wash. Your cazuela is ready for use - the garlic has created a seal. This technique has been used since the Middle Ages. It seasons the pot and hardens the unglazed parts. To clean, soak in sudsy water and scrub with a soft brush to remove any hardened food. If you have not used the cazuela for an extended period of time, you may need to re-cure it before use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nDSeS+DdL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Peregrino","source_asin":"B00XAEEIT2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00XAEEIT2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00XAEEIT2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
