window.products.push({"id":945238,"name":"Christmas Tree Ornaments - Figurine Glass from Christmas By Krebs - Handcrafted Hanging Holiday Decor for Trees (Color Blocks Hot Air Balloon)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ADALSWCpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Christmas By Krebs: Mouth Blown and Hand Decorated Glass Figurine  For over 70 years Christmas By Krebs has been creating perfect holiday memories one ornament at a time. We make handmade seamless glass figurines with silvered or aluminized interiors to create the most vibrant presentation possible. Get the best for your home and have the best Christmas yet with Christmas By Krebs. The Highest Quality  We start with a selection of designer colors carefully chosen to match and accentuate a wide range of Christmas decorations. Our ornaments are handmade by glass-working artisans. The combination of our vibrant colors and glitter and fine silvered or aluminized interiors creates the best presentation with the most pop for your trees. The Perfect Ornaments for Your Home  All of our ornaments have an elegant antique style with a filigree topper and loop perfect for hooks and hanging. Each ornament features a solid opaque color throughout. Choose from rose gold, light blue, pink, royal blue, dark red, black, white, silver, light red, lime green, dark green, hot pink, brown, copper, yellow, aqua, and more. Our syles help capture the fun of the season with many different styles. Select from all of the classic and new designs and find your new favorite tree accessories. Christmas By Krebs  We bring the festive joy and fun of Christmas to homes all over America with the highest quality gifts, art, and decorations. We've been a family owned company for four generations and we're proud to be a leader in keeping the tradition of fine handmade glass ornaments alive and well today. If you want to add that little something special to your Christmas, make sure you have a Christmas By Krebs!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ADALSWCpL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Christmas By Krebs","source_asin":"B0BP2HLH35","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945238","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BP2HLH35","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BP2HLH35","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":945239,"name":"Secura SWK-1701DB The Original Stainless Steel Double Wall Electric Water Kettle 1.8 Quart, Midnight Black (Renewed)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oKb6xGiuL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"This pre-owned or refurbished product has been professionally inspected and tested to work and look like new. How a product becomes part of Amazon Renewed, your destination for pre-owned, refurbished products: A customer buys a new product and returns it or trades it in for a newer or different model. That product is inspected and tested to work and look like new by Amazon-qualified suppliers. Then, the product is sold as an Amazon Renewed product on Amazon. If not satisfied with the purchase, renewed products are eligible for replacement or refund under the Amazon Renewed Guarantee.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51oKb6xGiuL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B07VYS5YQV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945239","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VYS5YQV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VYS5YQV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
