window.products.push({"id":945245,"name":"Emeril Everyday 6 QT Pressure Air Fryer, 5 Pc Accessory Pack, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616+aa29gGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Pressure Cook Tender – Air Fry Crisp! The Pressure Air Fryer 6 Quart Deluxe by Emeril Lagasse is a pressure cooker and crisping air fryer – all-in-one stainless steel pot. Crisp almost any meal with the perfect caramelized, golden brown finish. First, pressure cook to tenderize, lock in juices, and infuse flavor – up to 70% faster vs. traditional ovens. Roast chickens are falling-off-the-bone juicy with the perfect crispy skin, macaroni and cheese gets a crunchy breadcrumb topping, serve chili with the perfect golden cheesy finish, or bake your favorite sweet dessert with a crisp crumble. Pressure Cook faster vs. traditional ovens with two pressure levels, even when you’re in a rush. technology calibrates the precise time, pressure, and temperature required. Greaseless fryer gives you up to 70% fewer calories from fat vs. a deep fryer, so you can enjoy healthier versions of the same French fries, blooming onions, onion rings, and more. Rapid Air Technology creates a whirlwind of superheated air for crisping on all sides – even from frozen! Perfect Crisping Outside – Juicy Stays Inside: Pressure cook for an extra-tender result full of moisture and flavor, then use the airfryer crisper lid for a crispy golden finish. Enjoy the perfect combination of pressure cooking and air frying – all in one pot. 44 Programmable Cooking Functions – LCD Digital Display: Pressure Cook – custom (with recipes), beef, poultry, fish, pork, ribs, vegetables, beans, egg, barley, quinoa, risotto, white rice, brown rice, bake. Air Fry – custom (with recipes), beef, poultry, fish, bake, vegetables, dehydrate. Slow Cook – beef, poultry, pork, ribs, vegetables. Steam – fish, eggs, vegetables. Sauté – beef, poultry, fish, pork, ribs, vegetables. Sous Vide – beef, poultry, fish, pork, vegetables, egg. Canning – Default Cook Time: Short 10 min. /Med. 1h/Long 2h. Yogurt Maker – Default Cook Time: Short 5h/Med 7h/Long 9h.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616+aa29gGL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emeril Everyday","source_asin":"B0C27SBVW8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945245","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C27SBVW8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C27SBVW8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
