window.products.push({"id":945393,"name":"rudot home ® 12Pcs Large Spice Jars with 108 Labels, 2.5 Oz Glass Jars with Bamboo Lids Kitchen Canisters, Preprinted Spices Labels, Empty Round Spice","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DeuDyesTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️MINIMALIST SPICE JARS WITH BAMBOO LIDS : Taking inspiration from natural and minimalist design, RuDot Home glass spice jars combine bamboo and glass to create a modern yet rustic look instead of regular seasoning jars or seasoning containers, made of high-quality and lead-free glass, to ensure durability and safety. Clear glass spice jars with bamboo lids allow us to differentiate what’s inside, so lower the risk of picking up the wrong spices. ✔️AIRTIGHT GLASS CANISTERS : Natural bamboo has wide mouth open with food-grade silicone sealed rings creates an airtight seal to keep our spices as fresh as possible for long-time spice storage. Plus, the jar with lid has good suction to the spice jar, the airtight glass food storage containers with bamboo lids secure the jars with lids for spices tightly, keeping air and ants out. Spice containers with labels is also designed to be multipurpose. ✔️ CLASSY SPICE BOTTLES WITH 108 SPICE JAR LABELS: Comes with preprinted glass spice jars with labels, provides a classy appearance on our storage jars, which increases the sense of home aesthetic. We can identify and access all spices easily, giving spices container set a uniform look when they are placed together. 12 pack 2.5 Oz bamboo spice jars work perfectly to make the spice drawer uniform, organized also add a chic touch to our kitchen, cabinet or countertop. ✔️ KEEP FRESHNESS & MOISTURE PROOF WITH EASY TO CLEAN: The crystal glass containers with bamboo lids allows you to see what is inside and easily monitor whether your food has run out. Glass storage jars can be placed in the dishwasher for cleaning and placed in the refrigerator and microwave, while wooden bamboo lids can be wiped with cloth. This glass spice jars with labels of 12 Pcs jar with lid with all-round silicone sealing loop creates an airtight and moisture proof environment. ✔️ CAREFULLY PACKED & IDEAL GIFT: RuDot Home puts a soft layer on the top and bottom of the box to protect the empty spice jars, cardboard between individual kitchen jars to prevent scratching in a sturdy box. We added more packaging materials to reduce the damage of spice bottles empty glass with labels. Great gift for someone who likes organization, even use as decors to showcase your collection at the workplace. Large spice jars are perfect for tackling major pantry organization projects.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81DeuDyesTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"rudot home","source_asin":"B09Z33N92R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z33N92R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z33N92R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
