window.products.push({"id":945498,"name":"HomeMall Mini Humidifier, USB Personal Desktop Air Humidifier, Colorful Cool Mini Humidifier for Car, Bedroom, Office Room, Starry Sky Projection Lamp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51A3pYg-OJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why Do We Need a Mini Humidifier? The air is very dry in winter and in AC room. Whether you are a person always driving, work in a dry Office, or are looking for a good travel option, the mini humidifier can provide you with sweet relief in the dry air.  With Humidifier can Reduce asthma, Moisten Your Skin, Relieve stress, Improve breathing, Night light for bedroom and also can Create an atmosphere for your car.  Powered by a USB cable, you can use it anytime anywhere, you can plug it into your laptop, car or any standard USB charging block. HOW TO USE IT? Installation of springs and swabs; Add water into it; Plug in the USB power cord; Push the power button to start the mini humidifier.  Mini Spray Humidifier Features： 1, The 300ml water tank design can provide the air with moisture for up to 4-6 hours.  2, Quiet operation with less than 30dB.  3, USB powered, convenient to carry.  4, Automatic switch-off.once the water runs out,it wil be auto shut-off to protect the device.  5,Offers up to 6 hours runtime.  6,Cost-effective compared to larger versions.  7,Equipped with cotton swabs to filter impurities in the water.  8, With Aroma Essential Oil Diffuser function,You can add a few drops of your favorite essential oil to give your room a pleasant scent. Package Includes: 1 X portable humidifier 1 X USB cable 1 X humidifier cotton stick","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51A3pYg-OJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HomeMall","source_asin":"B09JJSDZ6B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JJSDZ6B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JJSDZ6B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":945499,"name":"Holm 100% Turkish Cotton Peshtemal Towels - Best Oversized (39x70) Pestemal Luxury Towel for Travel, Beach, Home Bathroom, Fouta, Picnic, etc (Labyrin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gFnAju-TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM TOWELS WITH A PURPOSE Holm towels are made of high quality fabric that makes your life better! However you use it, yo'll feel the difference at home or on the move. However, we don't think it's enough to just make premium towels. We believe it's important to spread some joy to those who don't have time to visit the beach or swim in clean pools - to those who wonder where they'll get their next drink of clean water. YOUR PURCHASE MAKES AN IMPACT! HOLM GIVES BACK 2% of HOLM's revenue funds solutions that address the most persistent needs of those living in extreme poverty. Giving back is a cornerstone to our philosophy - our purpose that drives our desire to create a positive global social impact through creative products. We take a three-pronged approach to our giving with a focus on HEALTH, WATER and EDUCATION WHO WE FUND Our current grantees drill clean water wells, provide rechargeable lanterns for children with no power so they can study, and they provide hygiene kits for girls so they can stay in school. Our goal is to empower kids and adults - with a focus in Ghana, Mali and other African countries. THE TOWELS Our fabric is made of 100% Turkish Cotton sewn to be strong and comfortable. Key features include tear-resistance, quick drying, a natural sun screen, colorful style, and extra large sizing. We believe top quality products make for top quality experiences - be it on the beach, playing in the surf, or just living an active lifestyle. We hope to create a premium product for a premium experience THANK YOU FOR SUPPORTING A GREATER CAUSE!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91gFnAju-TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Holm","source_asin":"B07QFC46QK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945499","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QFC46QK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QFC46QK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
