window.products.push({"id":945678,"name":"Digital Kitchen Timer, Desk Timer Cube,desktop timer,5 Volume Levels, Visual Timers LCD Display Magnetic Countdown Countup Timer for Kitchen, Homework","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Bg+I4srdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Creative Flip Timer】:Through research and analysis on all aspects of work and life, 8 time dimensions with high frequency of use are finally selected. The digital timer has 8 preset timing modules, 3/5/10/15/25/30/45/90 minutes, just rotate the timer to set time, turning the corresponding time number face up to quickly start the countdown. Unique cube design, easy to use and simple to operate. 【Custom Timing Mode】: This cube timer not only can be flipped to count down, but also has a custom countdown function, set as needed from 00:00~99:59, When the display is on or flashing, long press the \"p+\" button to increase the time, and long press the \"p-\" button to decrease the time, meet your different countdown needs. During the countdown, simply stand up the timer to pause the time. 【Adjustable Volume】This flip timer has 6 adjustable volume modes, the maximum volume is 5, the minimum volume is 0 (mute), and the volume can be increased or decreased by short pressing the \"V+/V-\" button of the timers, so you can choose the suitable volume according to different occasions to meet your different needs. 【Strong Magnet & Rechargeable】The strong magnetic design on the back of the visual timer can firmly stick on any iron surface, such as refrigerators and cabinets, freeing your hands. USB Charging, the timer can be used continuously for 12 hours after being fully charged, and in the case of no operation and no touch timer, it will enter the automatic standby state after 10 seconds to save power. The kitchen timer is non-slip and wear-resistant, long lasting and durable. 【Multiple scenes use】The kids timer adopts LCD high-definition display, which is clear and easy to read. Palm-sized, easy to put in your pocket, more portable. Our magnetic timer is widely used and suitable for all aspects of your life, such as kitchen cooking, sports fitness, beauty, study, games, sports, work meetings and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Bg+I4srdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAIMIM","source_asin":"B0B76PPYNL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945678","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B76PPYNL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B76PPYNL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
