window.products.push({"id":945710,"name":"AWANFI Oscillating Fan with Remote, Camping Fan with LED Light, 4 Speeds, Hanging Hook, Clip On Fan for Tent, Desk, Stroller, Camping, Office, Home","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kiUdJ2qoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"120°/360° Auto Oscillating, Silent Brushless Motor: with a genius function of auto oscillation of 120°/360°, this oscillating cooling fan can circulate air like a air circulator, rapidly reduce ambient temperature. And It can manually adjust the angle up, down, left and right by 720° to achieve all-round ventilation. In addition, equipped with high-performance brushless motor, the usb fan provides stronger airflow at a lower noise level(<20DB) 75 Hours Working Time 3-Speed Wind, Natural Wind Mode, 2 Level Light: This rechargeable USB fan has 3 level of speed, you can adjust it from soft wind to strong wind, maximun to 13ft/s. In addition, the \"Natural Wind\" mode reproduces a pleasant natural breeze, suitable for sleep. Buit-in 9 Warm LED lights, 2 level brightness adjustment, light up your outdoor camping night. Remote Control & Timer: This outdoor camping fan comes with a wireless remote, you can adjust speed of wind, brightness, rotation mode via it. And also you can choose timing mode by it, there are 0.5H mode, 1H mode, 1.5H mode and 2H mode opition. Clip On, Desk, Hanging All-in -One Fan: Equipped with a sturdy clamp, a foldable hook and non-slip pad, this USB camping fan can be clipped to a table leg, a stroller, be hanging on a tent, and be set on the desk, which make it can be used outdoors, living room, dorm, office or anywhere. The utilization rate is higher than that of ordinary electric fans! What U Will Get: 1* Camping Fan, 1* USB-C Cable, 1*Remote, 1* Manual, 12-Month Warranty. If you have any problem about the product, contact us to get a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kiUdJ2qoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AWANFI","source_asin":"B09ZHR55CZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945710","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZHR55CZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZHR55CZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
