window.products.push({"id":945883,"name":"Professional Chef Knife - Kiritsuke 8 Inch Kitchen Knife - Premium Ergonomic Ultra Sharp High Carbon German Stainless Steel - Pakkawood Handle Chef's ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C87HtTRuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our professional Kiritsuke Chef's knife is well suited to tackle all your culinary. The Kiritsuke knife is a professional 8 inch kitchen knife that has an ergonomic pakka handle with an excellent grip and perfect balance, superior control, agility and comfort with ergonomic black Pakkawood handle. The curve design from the handle to the tip is labor-saving cutting premium German 1.4116 Steel – Precisely forged of high-carbon German steel engineered to perfection at 56+ Rockwell hardness for long lasting performance, rust and stain resistant. The blade is hand sharpened by a 16-degree angle per side making for a sharper, longer lasting blade. The professional knife is well balanced, so you won’t feel dragged down. The knife’s ergonomics help reduce the chance of experiencing aches and fatigue in your hands. The blade edge minimizes the possibility of food sticking to the knife. Kiritsuke 切付 means “slit open”. A knife that crosses between two different Japanese chef's knives, the Gyutou and the Yanagi.These knives have hybrid design combining features of Japanese Usubas and Yanagibas knives which give them versatile and multipurpose characteristics. In the cuisine, Kiritsuke is often considered to be a symbol of expertise, status and seniority. Traditionally, these knives were used only by the executive chefs, and now we want everyone to have access to them and the best knives for those special moments. ​ Kiritsuke aims to bring the art of the best blades to your kitchen. We believe in making the perfect knives for your cuisine.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81C87HtTRuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KIRITSUKE","source_asin":"B09LSJNZKV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LSJNZKV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LSJNZKV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
