window.products.push({"id":945931,"name":"Mini Bag Sealer, Portable Vacuum Sealers, Chip Bag Sealer, Handheld Heat Seal, 2 in-1 Heat Seal and Cutter Mini Food Sealer for Plastic Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.84,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51L+pmjSe7L._AC_SL1475_.jpg","description":"With this mini bag sealer, you can keep food and snacks fresher, longer, and reduce food waste! Feature: 1. Advanced & efficient: Using advanced micro-heating technology, perfectly reseals unused food. 2. Simple & durable: can be reused many times, save space & plastic bags, seal quickly. 3. Small & Portable: Only 5.5 inches long, it can fit in a pocket, perfect for traveling & carrying. 4. Fast Sealing & Cutting Speed: sealing the bag at one end does not exceed 10 seconds, cutting the bag at the other end takes only 1 second. 5. Wide Range of Uses: The cutting machine can open all kinds of plastic bags & cartons. The sealing machine can seal a variety of common packaging bags, such as storage bags, snack bags, etc. How to Use: 1. Remove the plastic isolation source (new battery installed). 2. Before use, press & hold for 6-8 seconds to warm up. 3. Slowly slide the sealer along the edge of the bag. 4. The other end can be easily cut to open the bag. Kind Tips: 1. Do not heat for more than 3 minutes each time. 2. Not suitable for pure paper bags & aluminum foil bags. 3. The movement speed of the seal depends on the thickness of the plastic bag (thin bags should be sealed quickly, thick bags should be sealed slowly). 4. When the battery power is low, please replace the battery in time. 5. Please remove the battery when not in use for a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51L+pmjSe7L._AC_SL1475_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gotuvs","source_asin":"B0BNVNQC9K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945931","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNVNQC9K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNVNQC9K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
