window.products.push({"id":945975,"name":"Surmente Tablecloth 90 x 132-Inch Rectangular Polyester Table Cloth for Weddings, Banquets, or Restaurants (Red) ……","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mhOMw0bhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"High quality and Design: surmente's rectangular tablecloth is designed with high quality 180GSM polyester fiber, using the advanced technology of one-piece molding process, the four corners use rounded cutting design, the overall oval shape, so that the 90132 tablecloth is elegantly fit on the dining table, setting a pleasant atmosphere for your meal. Durable： Surmente linen tablecloths are made of fade-resistant, high-quality polyester fabric that retains the original crisp color of the tablecloth during use and cleaning, making them completely reusable. And our tablecloths provide good protection for your table furniture, thus avoiding damage from scratches sunlight stains. Easy Care: Surmente takes full account of your worries and concerns about cleaning tablecloths, which can be machine washed repeatedly in water at temperatures below 40°C without deformation, but it is recommended not to use bleach, and after cleaning, a simple ironing will make them look new. Applicable Size: This 90×132in rectangular tablecloth from Surmente is suitable for rectangular tables. To choose the tablecloth rectangle size for your dining table, you need to use the actual length of the table plus 8-16in and the actual width plus 8-16in, which is the size of the dining table cloths you need for your dining table. Multifunctional: This rectangular tablecloth is suitable for daily and party use, weddings, parties, holidays, catering, cafes, special occasions, dinners, brunches, potlucks, barbecues, buffets, baby showers, indoor and outdoor tablecloth use, etc. The Surmente team cares about your shopping experience, so if you have any problems with your purchase and use please contact us promptly and we will solve your problem within 24 hours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mhOMw0bhL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Surmente","source_asin":"B0C1SMC9MR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1SMC9MR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1SMC9MR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":945976,"name":"Up in Space Wall Clock Rocket Kid Astronaut Sci Fi Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zaJByjKjL._AC_.jpg","description":"get a fun wall clock for your home and office and show off your sense of style. looking for a fun, hilarious clock to hang on your cubicle or in your “ man cave”? if so, SignMission has all the Cute, funny, hilarious, and even work-related novelty clocks you’ re looking for! something for everyone we’ conve got a wide range of American-made clocks just like this one that will tickle your funny bone, make others smile, or even show off your snarky attitude. product details:This wall clock measures 10 inches in diameter. It has a Black plastic frame with a clear cover. The graphics are rich and vibrant and will last a lifetime.The clock has precision quartz movement and operates on 1 AA battery (not included).these Clocks make a great accent to any room in your home or business. A  perfect addition to your kitchen, bathroom, bedroom, family room or anywhere.&Nbsp;","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zaJByjKjL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SignMission","source_asin":"B017JCST04","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017JCST04","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017JCST04","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
