window.products.push({"id":945978,"name":"Le Creuset 2-3/4-Quart Oval Oven, Red","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517QhPjiu9L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"This attractive Le Creuset oval Dutch oven elegantly shifts from the oven to the table to the refrigerator, giving chefs a terrific all-in-one cooking vessel. As with other Le Creuset ovenware, the 2-3/4-quart pot is made of durable cast iron, a versatile cooking material that heats slowly but spreads its heat beautifully across the bottom and sides, eliminating \"hot spots\" and other cookware inefficiencies. The methodical heating method is ideal for slow-cooking casseroles, roasting turkeys, simmering sauces, or stewing beef and vegetables. In addition, the pot holds its heat long after the recipe is complete, keeping foods warm at the table well through a second serving. People who enjoy entertaining will appreciate the pot's twin layers of durable red enamel coating, which stylishly complements most cookware and tableware collections. The enamel also resists staining from acidic foods and is impervious to odors and flavors. Because Le Creuset cast-iron cookware retains heat so well, chefs can use low and medium temperatures yet still receive high-heat results. This efficient construction saves both energy and money, as does the tight-fitting lid, which helps form a blanket of heat that gently cooks foods while sealing in flavors. The pot features a pair of angled cast-iron side handles to make carrying easy, along with a stay-cool phenolic knob atop the lid that's heat-resistant to 356 degrees F. The pot is also dishwasher-safe and carries a limited lifetime warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517QhPjiu9L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Le Creuset","source_asin":"B0000C69LC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-945978","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000C69LC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000C69LC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
